'''Hermit Cat''' (ネコ仙人, ''Neko Sennin'', '''Cat Hermit''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears on the [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 30|30th]] and [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 49|49th]] floors of the [[Heavenly Tower]]. Defeating him on Floor 30 will unlock his [[Hermit Cat (Special Cat)|Cat Unit counterpart]] via [[Catnip Challenges]]. He was added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

