==Enemy==
Hermit Cat has extreme health along with a three-part multi-hit, each of which inflicts 22,222 damage and creates a Lv.5 [[Wave Attack]] on hit. He is a mid-range attacker and needs to be knocked back 12 times before death. He isn't threatening on his own, but the peons on Floor 30 can prove a handful and particularly lethal with him backing them.

